#: data/org.yangtse.Pixlay.metainfo.xml.in:22
msgid ""
"Pixlay lays photos out on a sheet: add one to nine of them, pick a layout, "
"frame each photo in its cell, give the collage a frame of its own and export "
"the finished image."
msgstr ""

